# Knowledge base: keep git able to descend into the folder ...
!knowledge_base/
# ... but ignore (almost) everything inside it by default ...
knowledge_base/*
# ... and re-allow only the confirmed public demo inserts below, so a fresh
# clone / Render instance gets a non-empty KB while future files stay ignored.
!knowledge_base/Aspirin_Package_Insert.pdf
!knowledge_base/Clopidogrel_Tablets_Insert.pdf
!knowledge_base/EguiYangxue_Package_Insert.pdf
!knowledge_base/Ibuprofen_Package_Insert.pdf
